WEBVTT

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.180
Answering a request from Prince Phil,
who's been the target of an assassin...

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.780
...we've become involved in an uproar
involving the Seyruun royal family.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:40.760
The one behind all this seems to be
Phil's younger brother Christopher.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:44.190
But, for some reason,
two Monsters have shown up as well!

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:48.130
It's pretty clear that the Monsters
are behind this whole case. However...

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.040
Lighting!

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:54.800
No way!

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:00.340
I... I can't use my magic now!

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:03.270
What am I going to do?!

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.850
Take care now!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.930
Hey! If anything happens,
we'll be sure to send word!

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.730
But will they really
be able to cure Lina?

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.930
That whoever-it-is on
Mt. whatever-it-was?

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.070
The sorcery doctor
Runan on Mt. Rune!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.080
It'll be all right. Even though he
retired to the mountain long ago...

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:37.050
...rumor has it he's in good health
and his skill hasn't diminished.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.480
Rumor has it? That's all we know?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:45.150
Daddy said that there's no better
wizard out there for breaking curses!

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:49.350
Well, even if it is only a rumor,
I have to go there to check it out.

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.760
To Mt. Rune...

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.730
We don't know what Kanzel
and the others will try next.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.570
Get yourself cured and
get back here quickly!

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.200
Oh...

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.270
So, does that mean you can't
handle this without me?

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:07.340
At the very least, it'll be
a lot harder to fight

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.440
two Monsters without your spells.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:13.210
Still... Are you sure you
should go by yourself?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.650
Phil's the one who
needs protection now.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.220
Oh, cut it out! Quit worrying!

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:26.160
As soon as I get my powers working,
I'll double-time it back here.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.530
Until then, guard Phil and watch out
for those Monsters! Take care of it!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.430
Still, despite everything I said...

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.040
...it really stinks not being
able to use my magic.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.180
This is no time to get depressed!

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.520
The thing for this
situation... is FOOD!

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.860
Eat, drink, and enjoy the journey!
That's what I say!

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.520
Step right up, folks!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.250
Step right up!

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.700
Th- That voice...

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:06.300
Cheap prices here, folks! One silver
piece and get a custom-made curse!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:10.210
M- Miss Martina, don't you
think this is going too far?

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.300
Master Xellos...

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.770
I finally realized!

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.380
Money is what makes
the world go 'round!

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.470
For getting your revenge...

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.850
For having tea with you,
my beloved.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.290
Everything requires money!

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.120
That's why I'm going
to work hard at this and...

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.690
I thought it was you, Martina!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.920
And besides you... Xellos?!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.290
You've finally come, Lina.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.730
Lina... You mean she was the one
you were waiting for, Master Xellos?!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.200
Yes, it was Lina.
Didn't I mention that?

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.540
My, these are certainly terrible
circumstances for a trip.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:47.770
You've had your
powers sealed, eh?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:51.040
You're certainly well-informed for
somebody who's been missing for a while.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.550
So, what are you doing here?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.880
I thought I'd accompany
you to the sorcery doctor.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.360
I've been waiting here for
you with Miss Martina.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.590
With "Miss Martina"?

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:06.930
Yes. I saved her from a gang
of bandits a few days ago...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.470
...and we've become friends.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:12.060
She said she wanted to come with us.
Is that all right with you?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.160
Is that all right? Uh, look...

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:30.220
When he defeated those awful bandits,
Master Xellos looked so gallant!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.530
And, as a result, Miss Martina seems
to be quite taken with me.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.300
That's not really the problem.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.240
But Miss Martina is
a very good person!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.600
Once she decided to get her
revenge, she hasn't wavered!

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.870
She'll use any means to get it!

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:53.570
That's why she works so
hard at her part-time jobs.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.880
Such ruthless and single-minded
devotion to a goal is quite admirable!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:02.610
Just HOW does that
make her a "good person"?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.710
Master Xellos...

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:34.580
Right, right.
Be sure you go home, okay?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.060
Oh, yes.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:55.840
I'm going to buy us some food.
Why don't you two go on ahead?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.030
Huh?! H- Hey, wait a minute!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.580
Here's my chance!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:01.980
Oh, Miss Martina?

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.170
Yes?!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.620
Your behavior reflects on me.
Be nice to her.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.250
Okay! I understand!

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:12.050
See you.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.380
I knew it...

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.900
So, at last we're all alone,
Lina Inverse!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.100
Oh, I may have forgotten
to mention this...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.930
...but no bullying Lina
while she can't do magic.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.830
S- Sure thing!

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:31.540
See you.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.010
I may have told
Master Xellos that, but...

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:35.210
I knew it...

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.340
It means I just can't
let him find out about it!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.980
Uh, wait... Martina!

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.720
Hang on a second, okay?

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.250
It won't work,
no matter what you try...

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:54.660
Now, then...

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.360
The magical circle
is complete. Next...

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.330
Give me something
that belongs to you!

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.270
Sure. Why even fight it?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.640
You've fallen into my trap,
Lina Inverse!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.110
This is a trap?

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.170
Your not having any
magic power is a chance...

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.880
...that the monstrous Zoamelgustar
in heaven has given me!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.250
I've been working and working,
polishing my skills...

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.420
...and now, feel the
terror of my curse!

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:36.970
You see?
The power of my curse?!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.240
It's sure taking its sweet time.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:41.040
Oh, shut up!

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:43.210
Come forth, lightning!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.420
Huh?! She really did it!

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.820
I thought I was gonna die...

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.130
Just killing you isn't what I want...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.710
Fire... BALL!

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:28.850
Oh, no! I forgot I can't do that!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.360
This sucks...

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.340
This sucks!
This sucks! This sucks!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.630
I never thought I'd be so useless
without being able to do magic!

00:09:41.710 --> 00:09:44.070
And I don't need YOU
making my life even worse!

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.740
Did my curse
teach you a lesson?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:51.180
Why, you... Once I've got my
powers back, I'm gonna flatten you!

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:55.980
Oh? You really think you'll reach
that sorcery doctor safely?

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:59.390
Oh? So you don't mind if I tell
"Master" Xellos about this?

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:02.550
What?! That's really playing dirty!

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:06.650
You play dirty! No, you do!
What does that mean?!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.130
They make an excellent team...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.800
Looks like this journey
will be a pleasant one.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:21.740
Ma'am, can I please
have some flour and salt?

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.050
Wow... That candy
sure looks good...

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.740
My treat. Take one!

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.150
Wow! Really? Thank you!

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:37.260
Excuse me, but do you know if
there's a sorcery doctor...

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.630
...named Runan
who lives around here?

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:41.760
Yes, I know him.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.800
Here it is.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.540
So, where's the doctor?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:58.950
Is he on a house call?

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.650
Oh, didn't I tell you?

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.880
I'M Runan the sorcery doctor!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:11.080
This... This girl?
This little girl?!

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:29.910
Hmm... So, your magic's
been sealed, huh?

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:33.250
That's really terrible!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:38.620
Th- This is the sorcery doctor
Lina's depending on?!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.760
QUIT LAUGHING!!!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.170
So, can I get my powers back?

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.170
Yes, you can.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.210
Really?!

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.400
Yup!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:12:00.380
Don't worry! I learned the cure
to this one really well!

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:03.850
I'm sure we had another patient in
here six years ago for the same thing.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:06.180
Grandpa and I treated him.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.380
Six years ago?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:12.080
Six years ago? But she doesn't
look more than ten years old!

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:15.320
Grandpa died of old age...

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:18.420
...so I took over the name
of Runan the sorcery doctor.

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.230
My real name's Kira!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.130
Oh, no!

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.330
Oh, boy...

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:36.040
Okay, next is the oppay fruit...

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:39.210
Then the kohma tail...

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:42.010
Sateeth powder, and, uh...

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:47.150
And, uh... Uh... Sorry,
can you read this for me?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:48.990
A... Aondora...

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:51.550
Oh, right! Right!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:54.060
Oh, boy...

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:58.570
Say, umm... Are you all right?

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:03.170
I'm doing fine!
Gotta stir it well now...

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:11.110
All right, then...
Please lie down here.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.910
Lina...

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:22.390
From what I can tell,
the mixture looks correct.

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.620
Come on, the proof is in
the doing. If you try it out...

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.930
Okay, why don't YOU
try drinking that stuff?!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:35.630
It may be a longshot, but if Lina
gets her powers back, my revenge is!

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.510
That should do it...

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.320
Master Xellos!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.760
Wh- What happened?!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.200
Well, of course it'd blow up if
you put this stuff into it!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.710
Mar... tin... a!!!!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:18.770
Oh? What? What?
It wasn't my fault!

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:23.120
You've done a bad
thing, Miss Martina.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:27.350
Besides that, you seem to have
attracted an unwelcome guest.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:38.730
You didn't do anything
again, did you?

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:42.360
How did you guess?

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.500
This is the curse
of Zoamelgustar!

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.940
No, this isn't.

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:01.330
Still impressive, even without
your powers, Lina Inverse!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:04.790
A... A Monster?!
What's it doing here?!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.920
I am a servant of Lord Kanzel.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:10.490
I go anywhere he
commands me to do my duty!

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.030
Kanzel? I should've known.

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:15.440
But you screwed
up your orders, pal!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.100
Wh- What?!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:20.670
Seyruun's THAT way!
I'm not with Phil now.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.250
How could you have screwed
up your orders like this?

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:27.410
There is no mistake. My business
is with you, Lina Inverse!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.590
With me? What is it?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:33.780
Yes. My orders are to kill you!

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.560
Go forth, lesser demons!

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:44.190
What's going on here?!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:47.460
I never expected a Monster
to show up around here!

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:50.030
Monster? That's a Monster?

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.370
Can't you tell just by looking at it?!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:57.110
Someone raised as well as I was
has never seen a Monster before!

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:58.980
Don't be so stuck-up!

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:01.820
You're one to talk,
you overbearing commoner!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.990
Guess I have to do what I can do.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.960
Help me!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:13.500
Master Xellos!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:17.060
Are you sure
we shouldn't help them?

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:21.440
There are a lot of complications
with that. I can't operate openly.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:29.470
Hm... The battle isn't
going so well, is it?

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.580
I can't last much longer...

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:36.750
Hmm...
You can still stand?

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.350
A person who doesn't give up their
dreams till the very end...

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:42.950
...even in the face of
overwhelming magical power...

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.790
...is a pretty cool character,
don't you think?

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.590
Then die as you wish to.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.490
Why do you want to kill me?

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.270
Don't you know?
Because you're a threat!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.570
How am I a threat?

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:58.200
I don't have to tell you that.

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:01.340
You say stuff like that
and I'll haunt you forever!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.900
So, haunt me. Now die.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.880
Oh! Magic power,
come back to me!

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.280
Elmekia Lance!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:13.820
Ah, I didn't think
it would work. Oh, well...

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:18.450
I'll help you just this once.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.260
Xellos?!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.420
Y- You?!

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:24.360
"Lord of Darkness
of the Four Worlds!"

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.770
This spell!

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:31.240
"Grant me all the power
that you possess!"

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.370
BLAST BOMB!!!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.090
Why are you here?!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.530
That's a secret.

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.740
Damn you!

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:20.920
Xellos, you...

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.390
What?! You can't make
any more medicine?!

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.300
What do you mean?!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:33.100
All the ingredients burned
up in that explosion before.

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.760
I am officially dumbfounded...

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:37.210
Well, that was a
close one, wasn't it?

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:42.370
Xellos, I owe you some thanks.
But, besides that...

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.950
...gimme those talismen!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.510
The one around your neck,
the one on your belt...

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:53.320
...and the two you wear on
your wrists as bracelets!

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:57.020
Those four things let you
increase your magical capacity!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:59.860
As observant as ever, I see.

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.900
At the very beginning,
the spell you cast...

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:04.090
...was basically a
magic amplification spell.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:07.430
If I can just amplify my powers,
I wouldn't have so much trouble.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:10.200
They're made from a
stone called Demon's Blood...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:15.610
...along with Ruby Eye, Dark Star,
Chaotic Blue, and Death Fog.

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:19.280
Basically, it combines the Dark Lords
of this world and the netherworld.

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:22.880
The Dark Lords of the netherworld?!
That's pretty hot stuff!

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.620
Anyway, gimme those talismen!

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:29.990
I... I can't! They were given to
me by a nobleman I did a favor for!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.430
200! No, I'll give
you 300 for them!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.520
Oh, Lina, you're so generous!

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:35.830
I said...

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:37.640
400!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.930
What do you want them for?!

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.840
Oh, Master Xellos!
Give them to me instead of Lina!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.340
I'll pay when I have the money!
On installments! No interest!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.240
Oh, is that your game? 500!

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:50.470
Um, actually...

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:51.610
510!

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:52.650
I was saying...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.550
520!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:54.380
530!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:56.250
No means no, you know?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.310
Ooh! 550!
How about that?!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:02.180
Maybe if it was
five and a half million...

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.230
All right, it's a deal!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.860
A bundle of crowley roots!
Two meltian potions!

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:12.800
A radilin ring! A remtite gem,
and crufer pills, too!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.370
With all of this, you can easily get
more than five and a half million!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.430
Now sell them!

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.880
B- But...

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.380
I said SELL THEM!

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.880
I suppose I have no choice...

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:33.050
But Lina, even if you use those,
you still can't use very powerful magic.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.560
I know, but there's
a bigger problem, too.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.860
Why are those Monsters
trying to kill me?

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:43.400
Say, what's this?

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.790
It looks like it was blown out
during that explosion before.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.610
Can it be?!

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.770
It is! It has to be! This is...

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.940
...a Claire Bible manuscript!
